{"id":"d83faf50f3b30d4d","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-high-set-subuniform-ce.md","title":"c.e. oracle 的可计算集合子统一表征","display":"thm-high-set-subuniform-ce — c.e. oracle 的可计算集合子统一表征","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-high-set-subuniform-ce","aliases":["20-thm-high-set-subuniform-ce"],"display":"thm-high-set-subuniform-ce — c.e. oracle 的可计算集合子统一表征","chapter":"4","section":"4.8.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.8.2(v)","source_printed_pages":[101],"source_pdf_pages":[137],"depends_on":["[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]","[[20-thm-high-function-enumeration]]","[[20-thm-martin-high]]","[[20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-high-set-subuniform-ce"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-high-set-subuniform-ce</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-high-set-subuniform-ce — c.e. oracle 的可计算集合子统一表征"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.8.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.8.2(v)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>101</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>137</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8756810b413a47d8\" href=\"?note=8756810b413a47d8\" title=\"20-df-uniform-matrix\">20-df-uniform-matrix</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc88f329ff785b03\" href=\"?note=fc88f329ff785b03\" title=\"20-thm-high-function-enumeration\">20-thm-high-function-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7f202b538b169b2\" href=\"?note=c7f202b538b169b2\" title=\"20-thm-martin-high\">20-thm-martin-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d1590e1a5b9442b9\" href=\"?note=d1590e1a5b9442b9\" title=\"20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus\">20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 c.e. 集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RecChar}=\\{\\chi_B:B\\in\\mathcal R\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{RecChar}=\\{\\chi_B:B\\in\\mathcal R\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8756810b413a47d8\" href=\"?note=8756810b413a47d8\" title=\"20-df-uniform-matrix\">20-df-uniform-matrix</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fc88f329ff785b03\" href=\"?note=fc88f329ff785b03\" title=\"20-thm-high-function-enumeration\">20-thm-high-function-enumeration</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c7f202b538b169b2\" href=\"?note=c7f202b538b169b2\" title=\"20-thm-martin-high\">20-thm-martin-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d1590e1a5b9442b9\" href=\"?note=d1590e1a5b9442b9\" title=\"20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus\">20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}high-set-subuniform-ce}\\vdash\n\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\le_T A&#39;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Subuniform}_A(\\mathsf{RecChar}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}high-set-subuniform-ce}\\vdash\n\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\le_T A&#39;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Subuniform}_A(\\mathsf{RecChar}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向将全可计算函数统一矩阵逐项截成二值。反向若不是 high，则任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算全函数都被某个普通可计算函数无限超出。给定候选矩阵的可计算二值近似，c.e. 模引理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算稳定模 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(e,x)\">\\(m(e,x)\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(x)=\\max_{e\\le x}m(e,\\langle e,x\\rangle)\">\\(p(x)=\\max_{e\\le x}m(e,\\langle e,x\\rangle)\\)</span>，选择可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 无限超出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>；在坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle e,x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle e,x\\rangle\\)</span> 用时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(x)\">\\(q(x)\\)</span> 的候选值取二值反值，便得到不等于任何行的可计算集合。有限初始例外对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 均可绕过。c.e. 假设保证稳定模的 oracle 界，不能省略。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.8.2(v)；印刷页 101；PDF 第 137 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-uniform-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"8756810b413a47d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-high-function-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"fc88f329ff785b03","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-high-function-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-martin-high","status":"resolved","id":"c7f202b538b169b2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-martin-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus","status":"resolved","id":"d1590e1a5b9442b9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-ce-oracle-ap